<title>TAIWAN: Taiwan 44-day NCDs average yield at 4.963 pct.</title>
<headline>Taiwan 44-day NCDs average yield at 4.963 pct.</headline>
<dateline>TAIPEI 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Taiwan's central bank issued T$10 billion in 44-day negotiable certificates of deposits on Wednesday at an average yield of 4.963 percent, a central bank official said.</p>
<p>The range of the bids was between 4.85 and 5.00 percent.</p>
<p>Demand totalled T$37.5 billion.</p>
<p>-- Taipei Newsroom (2-5080815)</p>
</text>
